  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "df9b6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 0,
      "content": "THIS MAJOR ACCEPTS THE ASSOCIATE DEGREE FOR TRANSFER (ADT)",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9f9e6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "A California Community College student who has earned the ADT (AA-T or AS-T) is granted priority admission to the CSU into a “similar” baccalaureate degree program with a guarantee of junior standing, as long as the student meets all prescribed admission requirements. ADT students will only be required to complete 60 additional semester units to complete the requirements for the “similar” baccalaureate degree. ADT 2-year roadmaps: https://www.cpp.edu/academic-programs/academic-advising/tools/sheets-roadmaps/index.shtml ADT accepted by Cal Poly Pomona: https://www.cpp.edu/admissions/transfer/associate-degree-for-transfer.shtml ADT Major &amp; Campus Search: https://www.calstate.edu/apply/transfer/Pages/associate-degree-for-transfer-major-and-campus- search.aspx",
      "contentHtml": "<p>A California Community College student who has earned the ADT (AA-T or AS-T) is granted priority admission to the CSU into a “similar” baccalaureate degree program with a guarantee of junior standing, as long as the student meets all prescribed admission requirements. ADT students <strong>will only be required to complete 60 additional semester units</strong> to complete the requirements for the “similar” baccalaureate degree.</p><p><br></p><p>ADT 2-year roadmaps: <a href=\"https://www.cpp.edu/academic-programs/academic-advising/tools/sheets-roadmaps/index.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.cpp.edu/academic-programs/academic-advising/tools/sheets-roadmaps/index.shtml</a></p><p><br></p><p>ADT accepted by Cal Poly Pomona: <a href=\"https://www.cpp.edu/admissions/transfer/associate-degree-for-transfer.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.cpp.edu/admissions/transfer/associate-degree-for-transfer.shtml</a></p><p><br></p><p>ADT Major &amp; Campus Search: <a href=\"https://www.calstate.edu/apply/transfer/Pages/associate-degree-for-transfer-major-and-campus-search.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.calstate.edu/apply/transfer/Pages/associate-degree-for-transfer-major-and-campus-</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.calstate.edu/apply/transfer/Pages/associate-degree-for-transfer-major-and-campus-search.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">search.aspx</a></p>"
